{"id":"b80fe1815b4b74ec","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-bounded-universal-section.md","title":"有界全称量化截面","display":"df-bounded-universal-section — 有界全称量化截面","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-bounded-universal-section","aliases":["18-df-bounded-universal-section","18-df-006"],"display":"df-bounded-universal-section — 有界全称量化截面","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"2.2.2","source_printed_pages":"12–13","source_pdf_pages":"23–24","source_correspondence":"bounded-quantifier-adaptation","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-bounded-universal-section"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-bounded-universal-section</span><span>18-df-006</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-universal-section — 有界全称量化截面"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc21fff5179104fc\" href=\"?note=dc21fff5179104fc\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation\">18-df-primitive-recursive-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12–13"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"23–24"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"bounded-quantifier-adaptation"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc21fff5179104fc\" href=\"?note=dc21fff5179104fc\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation\">18-df-primitive-recursive-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,\\vec x)\">\\((y,\\vec x)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec x\">\\(\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BAll}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BAll}_n\\)</span> 是本节点的截面算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BAll}\">\\(\\mathrm{BAll}\\)</span> 是在固定元数下的别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BAll}_n(R,z)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\forall y&lt;z\\;(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BAll}_n(R,z)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\forall y&lt;z\\;(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BAll}_n:\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{PRPred}_n,\n\\qquad \\mathrm{BAll}(R,z)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BAll}_n(R,z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BAll}_n:\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{PRPred}_n,\n\\qquad \\mathrm{BAll}(R,z)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BAll}_n(R,z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Lemma 2.2.2 给出有界量化封闭性；原书展示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le x\">\\(\\le x\\)</span>，这里用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;z\">\\(&lt;z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=0\">\\(z=0\\)</span> 时截面为全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>。固定界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 可用常函数代入，所得特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{y&lt;z}\\chi_R(y,\\vec x)\">\\(\\prod_{y&lt;z}\\chi_R(y,\\vec x)\\)</span>，空积为1；由本原递归及复合封闭性可得所列值域。修复 BAll 与 BAll_n 的接口漂移。已阅读并比对该封闭性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation","status":"resolved","id":"dc21fff5179104fc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation","status":"resolved","id":"dc21fff5179104fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,z\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}$；$\\mathrm{PRPred}_n$ 见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}_n","display":false},{"tex":"(y,\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BAll}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BAll}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BAll}_n(R,z)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\forall y<z\\;(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BAll}_n:\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{PRPred}_n,\n\\qquad \\mathrm{BAll}(R,z)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BAll}_n(R,z).","display":true},{"tex":"\\le x","display":false},{"tex":"<z","display":false},{"tex":"z=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{y<z}\\chi_R(y,\\vec x)","display":false}],"bytes":1586,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-bounded-universal-section]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-bounded-universal-section]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-bounded-universal-section]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-bounded-universal-section|18-df-bounded-universal-section]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-bounded-universal-section|18-df-bounded-universal-section]]"}],"outgoing":["dc21fff5179104fc"]}